{"Plugin request logs now rely on logger.FromContext(ctx) to include traceID, but the traceID contextual log provider is registered only when tracing.ProvideService is called. In tests or non-standard setups where spans exist but ProvideService wasn't invoked, plugin request logs can silently lose trace IDs.": 0.29549452662467957, "TestLogger.FromContext returns a brand-new TestLogger, dropping the original logger's accumulated state and violating the Logger contract that the returned logger should include 'this logger's context plus the given context'. This breaks tests or code paths that log via logger.FromContext(ctx) because logs go to a different instance than the one under assertion.": 0.868340253829956}